      "name": "Zefanja",
      "created_at": "2025-08-25T19:38:25.563Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>I try to submit in POS closing entry with <em>many</em> linked invoices (ca. 4500). After ca. 10 min I get a timeout error message. The status is “queued” but there no background jobs running.</p>\n<p>Any ideas what I can do to submit this big POS closing entry? Is there a way to increase the timeout (I tried increasing the http_timeout, but then it fails silently with the same “symptoms”).</p>\n<p>Is there a way to split the POS closing entry to decrease the number of linked invoices?</p>\n<p>Thank you for your help!</p>\n<p>Regards,<br>\nStephan</p>",
