      "created_at": "2025-08-26T04:44:01.920Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/zefanja\">@zefanja</a></p>\n<p>Try closing with <strong>just 100 invoices</strong> → if it succeeds, then scale to 500, 1000. That will confirm as it’s just volume.</p>\n<p>Otherwise Newer ERPNext version improved POS Closing handling. Upgrading can help.<br>\nbetter to promote App as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/5/b579b6227c39137350cdbcee0c8cc4483bcc287d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/b579b6227c39137350cdbcee0c8cc4483bcc287d\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b579b6227c39137350cdbcee0c8cc4483bcc287d_2_482x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"pTpbDKnip7o8DnK3YHRINC1iyNn\" width=\"482\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b579b6227c39137350cdbcee0c8cc4483bcc287d_2_482x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/5/b579b6227c39137350cdbcee0c8cc4483bcc287d_2_723x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/5/b579b6227c39137350cdbcee0c8cc4483bcc287d.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F6EC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">860×891 61.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
